WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
They put their blood, sweat, tears, money into that country,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.640
and now they're being ruined.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.560
Proud nations must be allowed to protect their communities

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.120
and prevent their societies from being overwhelmed by people

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.920
they have never seen before with different.

